<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:39:07 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>中度烘焙</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9826f6cb198</link><description>&lt;p&gt;中度烘焙&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Torra média" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a9826f6cb198.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:39:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一个网页展示了一个预填了"icke.lol"的URL输入框、一个"PREVIEW"按钮和三个示例用户名。其下方是标题为"METADATA AND RSS"的区域，显示了一张"Friedenau"路牌图片和一个检查清单，标示元数据及RSS订阅源检查中成功与失败的项目。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a97bc9ea50a2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个网页展示了一个预填了"icke.lol"的URL输入框、一个"PREVIEW"按钮和三个示例用户名。其下方是标题为"METADATA AND RSS"的区域，显示了一张"Friedenau"路牌图片和一个检查清单，标示元数据及RSS订阅源检查中成功与失败的项目。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A web page showing a URL input field with "icke.lol" pre-filled, a "PREVIEW" button, and three example usernames. Below this, a section titled "METADATA AND RSS" displays an image of a "Friedenau" road sign and a checklist indicating successful and failed metadata and RSS feed checks. - Eine Webseite, die ein URL-Eingabefeld mit vorausgefüllter URL "icke.lol", eine Schaltfläche "PREVIEW" und drei Beispielbenutzernamen zeigt. Darunter wird im Abschnitt "METADATA AND RSS" ein Bild eines Straßenschilds "Friedenau" und eine Checkliste mit erfolgreichen und fehlgeschlagenen Metadaten- und RSS-Feed-Prüfungen angezeigt.' height="1546" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a97bc9ea50a2.png" width="2698"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 06:05:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>侧鞍斜视</title><link>https://some.pics/6a975b0d8fa10</link><description>&lt;p&gt;侧鞍斜视&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A black and white dog in a harness leash sitting on a sidewalk. Her tongue is out. " height="4080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ckr/6a975b0d8fa10.jpg" width="3064"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ckr.some.pics"&gt;@ckr&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 23:09:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Parque Cerro Tío Pio，马德里（2016年）</title><link>https://some.pics/6a97514c0fd10</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Parque Cerro Tío Pio，马德里（2016年）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Parque Cerro Tío Pio, Madrid (2016)" height="2584" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a97514c0fd10.jpg" width="4592"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 22:27:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>库里蒂巴中心</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96edd5a213a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;库里蒂巴市中心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Centro de Curitiba" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a96edd5a213a.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:23:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>海浪</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96d4570f8b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;海浪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Waves" height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6a96d4570f8b4.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:34:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>铁轨延伸向远方，上方是湛蓝的天空和蓬松的白云，两旁是茂密的绿树和公寓楼群。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96c2b75e26b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;铁轨延伸向远方，上方是湛蓝的天空和蓬松的白云，两旁是茂密的绿树和公寓楼群。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Train tracks leading into the distance under a bright blue sky with fluffy white clouds, bordered by lush green trees and apartment buildings. - Bahngeleise, die sich unter einem strahlend blauen Himmel mit flauschigen weißen Wolken in die Ferne erstrecken, gesäumt von üppigen grünen Bäumen und Mehrfamilienhäusern." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a96c2b75e26b.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 12:19:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>哈哈，早安</title><link>https://some.pics/6a966e4b8bf46</link><description>&lt;p&gt;lol，早上好！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="lol, goeiemorgen!" height="3937" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a966e4b8bf46.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 06:18:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>沙科皮风景步道</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96476b533b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;沙科皮市（明尼苏达州）塔帕至风景区高地排水通道步道&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A paved path extends into the golden light of a sunset, bordered by green grassy hills and trees." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a96476b533b4.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 03:33:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>窗边比心</title><link>https://some.pics/6a95f6be7c0fd</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🪟🫳🏻❤️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small black and white dog stands on her hind legs at a window so the hand reaching in can scratch her head." height="2448" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jinx/6a95f6be7c0fd.jpg" width="3264"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jinx.some.pics"&gt;@jinx&lt;/a&g